h2("11.2  Track Conversion By Role");
p("What gets measured gets improved. Track these numbers by individual team member so coaching is specific rather than general.");
bulletRich([{ text: "Front desk: ", bold: true }, { text: "inquiry-to-booked-consult rate, confirmation-to-show rate, and check-out rebooking rate." }]);
